      "rules": [
        {
          "body": "Confirm whether subscription startup can emit synchronously and whether the consumer must receive that emission. Identify the consumer lifetime that owns delivery and cleanup, including synchronous callback reentry. Distinguish listener removal from completion of work already started. Confirm whether a transport can be reused across separate visits before using transport identity as a validity check.",
